  body
  ** Grandchild
  ** Sibling

Given org (top level cannot be promoted):
  * A
  ** B

Execute:
  call org#headline#promote()

Expect org:
  * A
  ** B

Given org (visual shift touches only headlines, clamped at level 1):
  * A
  text
  ** B
  *** C

Do:
  Vjj:\<C-u>call org#headline#shift_visual(-1)\<CR>

